1046 0 obj
  << /ActualText (     EXPERIENCE\n  \n     Apple \057 Visual Designer\n     Cupertino \055 Los Angeles\054 CA  2018 \055 Present\n\nExpanded into hands\055on front\055end development\054 using AI tools \050Claude\051 to translate designs into working code\054 building and debugging live web experiences in HTML\054 CSS\054 and JavaScript\056\nLed the visual design of multiple Apps and Games collections on the App Store\054 shaping cohesive visual systems from concept to launch\056\nPartnered with cross\055functional teams\054 editorial\054 product\054 and marketing on major launches\054 delivering content across iPhone\054 iPad\054 Apple TV\054 Apple Watch\054 and Apple Vision Pro\056 )
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1047 0 R
     /Pg 1042 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

