1048 0 obj
  << /ActualText (     Disney \057 Senior Designer\n     Glendale\054 CA  04\0562016 \055 10\0562017\n\nLed the visual design for multiple Disney sweepstakes landing pages\054 I focused on creating a seamless balance between visual appeal and user functionality\056 I created layouts that were both intuitive and engaging\054 supporting clear calls to action and responsive interaction\056\240\nI developed the marketing brand style guide for Disney Baby and oversaw the production of cross\055platform design assets\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1049 0 R
     /Pg 1042 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

