1050 0 obj
  << /ActualText (     michellexliu\056com \057 Freelancer\n     Los Angeles\054 CA  2016 \055 2018\n\nModernized content templates for hundreds of classic TV titles across AT\046T\054 Hulu\054 and Fox Sports\054 creating scalable\054 user\055focused designs\056 \nDesigned responsive interfaces and promotional content for AT\046T products on att\056com\054 ensuring consistency across devices\056 Focused on usability\054 brand alignment\054 and performance to deliver clean\054 effective digital experiences\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 1051 0 R
     /Pg 1042 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
